# Docker matches these patterns against the path relative to the build context,
# so a bare name like `.next` only excludes the entry at the repo root. Every
# rule below is `**/...` on purpose: the nested copies were being copied in.
#
# apps/web/.next (327 MB), apps/web/.open-next (570 MB) and apps/web/.sst
# (536 MB) shipped inside the image, which is what pushed it to 4.3 GB and made
# every build re-transfer the context and spend minutes exporting layers.
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.open-next/
**/.sst/
**/.turbo/
**/dist/
**/.git/
**/.agents/
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
